{
  "what": "The declared shape-priced re-measure: the held-out homophonic screen's six (file, language) cells re-measured with the mapped set, streams, split, seeds, machinery, restarts, sweep cap, plants, floors and band unchanged and the declared score table rebuilt in its leave-one-out form, so the climb searches the same space against a table whose occurring pair types carry one occurrence more severity. The bridge gate re-derived the frozen measurement under the inherited table through this measurement's code before the leave-one-out cells ran. The declared truthful question: does the real's margin above the band survive a model the climb cannot feed on - a yes says the margin rides the manuscript's statistics, a no records which instrument carried it. No mapping is published; nothing here is a reading.",
  "declared": {
    "base_seed": 20261020,
    "mapped": 36,
    "restarts": 16,
    "sweep_cap": 200,
    "plants_per_cell": 5,
    "floors": 5,
    "loo_rule": "the declared score table rebuilt: the inherited add-one form is log((n_ab + 1) / (N + 729)) with N the reference stream's total counted pairs; in the leave-one-out form every pair type (a, b) present in the reference pair table is scored with one occurrence of (a, b) removed from the reference counts, log(n_ab / (N + 728)), and a type with no counted occurrence keeps the inherited add-one entry log(1 / (N + 729)); every occurring type is re-priced one occurrence more severely and the unseen-type floor is unchanged; the declared conditional on re-deriving the matrix arithmetic resolves as not needed, the model staying the reference's aggregate and the score one fixed 27 x 27 table per language summed by assignment aggregation (the sum over pair occurrences of table[first label, second label])",
    "letter_counts_rule": "the model's letter marginals are the reference unigram counts, unchanged by the leave-one-out re-pricing, so the rank initialisation consumes the same marginals and starts identically to the held-out screen",
    "measured_facts_rule": "the mapped set, streams, split, seeds, machinery, restarts, sweep cap, plants, floors and band are the held-out screen's declarations replayed unchanged; the encodings and shuffles are byte-identical replays of the frozen measurement's draws and only the scoring changes; each side's exact full-data side call is recorded beside its held-out value for attribution only",
    "split_rule": "the counted pairs of each side, in stream order, split by pair-index parity: even indices the climb half, odd indices the score half it may never touch; deterministic, consuming no seed, as the held-out screen declared",
    "machinery_rule": "unchanged from the held-out screen: the exact greedy reassignment climb on the climb half, exact pricing on the score half, restart 0 the rank initialisation from the climb half, restarts 1 onward the seeded permutations of the 27 letter tokens under the wrap rule, the best restart the best exact climb-half total with ties to the first; no assignment is stored",
    "seed_kinds": {
      "real": 1,
      "homo_plant": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "homo_floor": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "homo_cross": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    "seed_sharing": "no new seed kinds are consumed; the declared draws are replayed from the declared kinds and this measurement consumes none of any other module's declared draws",
    "bridge_gate": "before the leave-one-out cells run, the shape instrument's full first cell (ZL english: the real, its five plants, its five floors and its three band members) is computed through this measurement's code under the inherited add-one table and compared field for field against the held-out screen's own outputs; any divergence aborts with nothing written",
    "band_record_rule": "membership, selection, ties and spreads are declared unchanged from the held-out screen (a member's band value the held-out value of the draw whose exact climb-half total is best, strict beyond 1e-12, ties to the first draw); each member additionally records draws_climb_exact, its five climb-half totals at full precision, so the declared selection is re-derivable from the stored artifact, because four-decimal rounded totals can coincide where exact totals differ",
    "verdict_rule": "unchanged from the held-out screen and applied to the leave-one-out-scale numbers: the real held-out at or above the smallest member band value is consistent-with-substitution, at or below the largest floor's held-out value is not-consistent, strictly between is below-held-band; the strings describe consistency under this artifact's declared leave-one-out form and do not restate the add-one form's verdicts",
    "margin_rule": "the margin is computed from the stored rounded values: the real held-out mean minus the smallest member band value, rounded to four decimals",
    "exclusion_rule": "the family's declared exclusion format is not re-scoped by this artifact: it keys to the declared 36-slot class under the inherited add-one form exactly as the held-out screen declared it, so a leave-one-out verdict is shape-instrument evidence and the ladder-arc verdicts stand untouched by this artifact's numbers",
    "truthful_question": "declared in advance: does the real's margin above the band survive a model the climb cannot feed on - a yes says the margin rides the manuscript's statistics, a no records which instrument carried it; if the margin does not survive, record which instrument carried it",
